# Ippatsu expires on the riichi seat's next own discard when no calls intervene
# (engine.md §4.2 Ippatsu, rules.md §2.1, §4.26).
# Seat 0 declares double riichi and discards 9m.
# Seats 1, 2, 3 tsumogiri (unbroken cycle); Seat 0 draws 1z (no win) and tsumogiris -> ippatsu expires!
# Immediately after, Seat 1 draws and discards 7s -> Seat 0 rons 7s WITHOUT ippatsu!
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + ron 7s (dora ind 1z, ura ind 1z -> 0 dora)
#   Yaku: double_riichi (2) + pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 4 han 30 fu (NO ippatsu!)
#   Dealer 4 han 30 fu ron = 11600 from Seat 1 (with ippatsu it would be 12000).

